{"id":"wb-7-1136","name":"永丰塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"永丰塔 (山东)","text":"永丰塔，又称梵塔，位于山东省巨野县县城东南角，汽车站附近。2006年公布为山东省文物保护单位。现为全国重点文物保护单位。\n根据《巨野县志》，永丰塔始建于唐代，完成于宋代。明、清多有修缮。1990年，全县居民集资18万元，再次进行了维修。\n永丰塔是楼阁式砖塔，八棱等边，共四门，现存五层，塔高31米，底层周长44米，最上层周长36米。四面环水。其南侧有一座摒盗碑（石碑下是一只大乌龟，上面是一只盘旋的龙）。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B0%B8%E4%B8%B0%E5%A1%94_(%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%9C)","revisionId":86783245,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86783245","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5356b8246807d58b7ea27dfa.jpg","title":"Yongfeng_Ta,_Juye.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yongfeng_Ta,_Juye.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/Yongfeng_Ta%2C_Juye.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"S.Z.","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​展示的是拍摄于23.6.22的永丰塔，修建于宋朝的佛塔，目前维护欠佳，停止参观。","width":320,"height":240}}